# Secret of the Damp Scroll (outlands 135): Shivivi talked to twice while accepted (Task 4 review). Her script only
# paths her about (onSpawn; no onTrigger), so the lookup has no fallback to alternate with: 32 on both talks. A level 10
# Warrior in Norg, accepted (a GM).
lists Norg/Shivivi/onTrigger
char zone=Norg pos=71.62,-6.281,-7.341 job=WAR lvl=10
quest Outlands.SecretOfTheDampScroll accepted
login
trigger Shivivi                         # 32
finish
trigger Shivivi                         # 32 again: no script turn
finish
